  "title": "Mississippi Sin Ham Dip",
  "description": "There may be 'sin' in the name, but there's goodness in every scoop. This gooey, cheesy, ham-filled dip gets a spicy kick from diced green chiles and McCormick® Taco Seasoning Mix.",
